      "sourceTextSha256": "bac1ce11b7f18636ffa5df3c9db9650604eb72936b767517009191e2af202401",
      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast, then the Brazilian side of the falls with an English-speaking guide. On the border of Brazil, Argentina and Paraguay, the Iguazu River, calm above the falls, plunges down some 275 cascades into the Devil’s Throat gorge, up to about 80 m deep. Optional: the Bird Park (USD 50 per person) and the Macuco Safari (USD 130 per person), by open jeep through the jungle and by motorboat right up to the falls.",
